      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\"Jack is a tall, energetic boy who loves sports. He has short, blond hair and bright blue eyes. Jack is very friendly and funny — he always makes his friends laugh. He’s also smart and curious, always asking questions about everything."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "At school, Jack is a good student. He studies hard and gets good grades, especially in science and math. He’s also very helpful. When his friends don’t understand something, he patiently explains it to them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "On the weekends, Jack plays soccer with his team. He’s fast and strong, and everyone says he’s a great player. After the game, he loves going to his favorite pizza place. Jack always orders a big cheese pizza and a cold soda."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jack’s dream is to become a scientist one day because he wants to invent something that helps people. His parents are very proud of him, and his friends think he’s amazing.\""
          }
        ]
