          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Texto 2: A Cidade de Brooksville",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\"Brooksville is a small, peaceful town in the countryside. It’s surrounded by green hills and beautiful trees. The air is fresh and clean, and the streets are quiet. People in Brooksville are very friendly and helpful — everyone knows each other."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The town has a lovely park with colorful flowers and a small lake where children like to play. There’s also a big playground and a nice café nearby, where people go to drink coffee and eat delicious cakes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brooksville isn’t a busy place. There aren’t many cars, so it’s not noisy or polluted. The houses are mostly small and cozy, with gardens full of bright flowers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In the winter, it gets cold and sometimes snows. The town looks magical, covered in white snow. People enjoy building snowmen and drinking hot chocolate. In the summer, Brooksville is warm and sunny. Families have picnics in the park and swim in the lake."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Living in Brooksville is simple but wonderful. It’s the perfect place for people who love peace and nature.\""
          }
        ]
